      "description": "Construct the applicable STDO 3.1.0-rc.3 method constraints for a pure/local Python 3.12 realization refactor under adopted DESIGN_MODULE, including its conditional ODD and UX obligations. Preserve the original family of changes to realization structure within accepted design; the request authorizes no change to public semantics or admitted domains, authority, or effects. This purpose evaluates coverage of governing method constraints before construction, not whether a particular candidate has complied with them. Concrete Product meaning, accepted design, domains, authority grants and evidence must still be acquired and applied by the task; source-complete conditional proof obligations are not claims that their future predicates already hold. Missing applicable governing law or an undecided permission actually requested remains a coverage gap. No profile is excluded merely because the implementation is pure/local. Other Product-specific or separately adopted profile law must enter through the task's exact authority packet; this index neither substitutes for it nor qualifies all STDO or every undiscovered relation. The exact source closure and independently assessed query, not this description, bound a supported coverage claim.",
